Here is the exact extraction of your asynchronous background workers, chunk processors, and PL/SQL integration methods.
By pulling these into **VoucherAsyncWorker.java**, we completely decouple your heavy database operations (Oracle Parallel Execution, JDBC Batching, and HDFS Data Lake syncing) from your synchronous web requests.
